					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Async loading\n\nItems load asynchronously — `scrollToIndex:` won't work. Predicate-based `scrollToItemSuchThat:offset:` returns a promise and waits for a matching item. Hence {{gtClass:name=ElixirFunctionScrollTarget}} + {{gtMethod:name=GtStreamingCodersViewModel>>scrollToTarget:}}. Reference: {{gtMethod:name=GtPharoStreamingMethodsCoderElement>>updateScrollTarget:}}."
			},
